  briefing: 'The raiders hold the village at the end of the road. It is too far to walk and beyond the HQ''s supply: load a truck, carry supply to the front, bring up a recon car, and take the village.'
  objectives: "Carry a squad and the supply unit to the front by truck.\nDestroy the lookout.\nCapture the village with a grunt."
