  - Character: Placeholder Commander
    Text: 'That''s how an army moves: on wheels, with its supply behind it.'
    Sound: 
    Portrait: 0
  - Character: Placeholder Scout
    Text: 'You''re ready for the real thing.'
    Sound: 
